<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says wins major Russian contract.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says wins major Russian contract.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson said on Thursday it had won a major contract for three new D-AMPS/AMPS systems by Millicom International Cellular (MIC) in Russia.</p>
</text>
